{# — Discovery resolver (series/author completion, ADR-060) — #}
<div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 24px;">Discovery Resolver (ADR-060)</div>
<p class="section-legend">
    Read-only view of the pooled series/author completion cache and the pressure it puts on
    Wikidata/Inventaire. Series completion is the only lane shipped so far (volet 1); author
