        <div class="stat-label">
            Next Expiry
            <i class="tip" data-tip="Soonest expires_at still in the pool. Resolved rows live 30 days, ambiguous/unknown rows 7 days (ADR-060 section 3.3). Swept nightly by app:db:prune.">i</i>
