    Charts cover the last 30 days for loans and last 8 weeks for library growth.
</p>

<div class="stat-grid" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">
            Total Books
            <i class="tip" data-tip="Sum of all book_count values across registered libraries. Updated each time a library syncs with the hub.">i</i>
        </div>
